  "analysis": [
    "Baseline errors are predominantly one string above the player, e.g. true frets 8, 6, 7 predicted as 3, 1, 2. Several solo phrases choose the wrong position throughout.",
    "The final low-position prior remains height=0.02; open-string cost and candidate count are unchanged.",
